    "explanation": "Both advocates measured this trip the same way and I agree with them, so here is the arithmetic in plain terms. This was a RYDE_POOL booking, and POL-RD-12 makes the matched-itinerary optimal of 19.40 km, quoted when the co-rider was matched, the correct baseline (EV-TRIP-00113). The 15.80 km solo_optimal_distance_km is carried 'for reference only'; the 28% longer figure in the claim is measured against that reference figure and is not the test. The governing distance is the GPS trace (EV-GPS-00113): 217 fixes, 100% coverage, no gaps, max gap 0.0 s, so it is unimpaired under POL-RD-07 and no discount and no independent corroboration is needed. The trace records 20.18 km. Excess = 20.18 - 19.40 = 0.78 km, which is 4.02% of the matched optimal. POL-RD-01 requires the excess to be greater than 0.8 km absolute AND greater than 20% of optimal; both gates must pass. 0.78 km and 4.02% fail both. No deviation is established, and POL-RD-01 directs the outcome to NO_ACTION however the trip felt. Note the trap the clause closes: the trip record's rounded actual_distance_km of 20.2 would give exactly 0.8 km and read as material, which is precisely why POL-RD-01 says the trace figure, not the rounded convenience copy, governs. The Hougang leg does not change this: the platform announced the pooled route and the 19.4 km estimate at 18:42:04, read by the rider at 18:42:31, before the trip started at 18:47:10 (EV-CHAT-00113), and POL-RD-12 excludes co-rider collection distance from the test in any event. No rider instruction to divert appears in the chat and no message carries a waypoint_hint, so POL-RD-04 exonerates nothing either. Because no deviation is established, POL-RD-02 never runs and no distance or time refund is available; for transparency only, a recomputation on 19.40 km and 34 min would give 25.67 against the 26.83 charged, a difference of 1.16 (1.20 rounded up), and that route is closed at the threshold. There is no billing-integrity correction to make: erp_lines is empty (0.00), the airport surcharge is 0.00 on a trip that neither starts nor ends at an airport, and the 3.00 pool discount was already subtracted, so POL-RD-09(4) produces nothing and no referral issues. The driver's record is clean - deviation_flags_90d is 0 over 471 completed trips in 90 days - so POL-RD-06 is not engaged, no pattern is established and no conduct referral follows; profile fields are credibility weighting only under POL-GEN-01. The missing LTA advisory (EV-ADVIS-00113-01, weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT) is disclosed by the rider's own claim, carries no fact, and is not needed because POL-RD-12, not POL-RD-03, decides this case. The driver's claim that the chat log corroborated the route was discarded at the citation stage for citing that missing artifact without naming its issue code; its substance is covered by the surviving chat evidence. Nothing in the ruling rests on an artifact below weight 1.0, so confidence is not capped below 1.0. The charge of SGD 26.83 stands and the present state is preserved."
